        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline Only / Solo Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No internet connection required—enjoy the full experience on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-on-4 Team Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All teammates and enemies are AI-controlled. Teamwork and situational awareness are the keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Controls × Fast-Paced Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated inputs required. Enjoy speedy robot battles with intuitive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage-Clear Progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage introduces powerful bosses. Clear a stage to earn points, then use those points to unlock new weapons. Gaining stronger equipment expands your tactical options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite simple rules, battles are intense and difficult. Repeated attempts are often required, but the sense of achievement when you finally succeed is immense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to pilot your robot and defeat the enemy team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced combat action and simple yet powerful battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Humanity was defeated by AI technology. Yet, it did not perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bipedal weapons created by AI were captured and modified for human use. Reprogrammed AI units were added as allies, and the fight began anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are humanity’s last pilot. With three AI partners at your side, launch into battle.”</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline Only / Solo Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No internet connection required—enjoy the full experience on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-on-4 Team Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All teammates and enemies are AI-controlled. Teamwork and situational awareness are the keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Controls × Fast-Paced Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated inputs required. Enjoy speedy robot battles with intuitive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage-Clear Progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage introduces powerful bosses. Clear a stage to earn points, then use those points to unlock new weapons. Gaining stronger equipment expands your tactical options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite simple rules, battles are intense and difficult. Repeated attempts are often required, but the sense of achievement when you finally succeed is immense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to pilot your robot and defeat the enemy team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced combat action and simple yet powerful battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Humanity was defeated by AI technology. Yet, it did not perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bipedal weapons created by AI were captured and modified for human use. Reprogrammed AI units were added as allies, and the fight began anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are humanity’s last pilot. With three AI partners at your side, launch into battle.”</p>",
        "short_description": "Steel Mech Battle is a 3D robot action game designed exclusively for solo and offline play. Team up with AI allies and take on 4-on-4 battles as you progress through each stage. Defeat enemies to earn points and unlock stronger weapons, experiencing stage-clear style action with every victory.",
